       This  page  summarizes data types, constants, and variables provided by
       the _c_u_r_s_e_s library.  Locate further discussion in ccuurrsseess(3X).

       Depending on _n_c_u_r_s_e_s's build-time configuration, the variables may  in‐
       stead be macros (see ccuurrss__tthhrreeaaddss(3X) and ccuurrss__ooppaaqquuee(3X)) that provide
       read-only access to the library's state.  In either case,  applications
       should treat them as read-only to avoid confusing the library.

