   _b_o_o_l
       X/Open  Issue  4 _c_u_r_s_e_s (1996) preceded the ISO C99 and ISO C++98 stan‐
       dards, each of which also defined a Boolean data type.  The _c_u_r_s_e_s  li‐
       brary requires an integral type _b_o_o_l.

       nnccuurrsseess'  configure  script  attempts to discover the data type used by
       the system's C and C++ compilers, to reuse for the _c_u_r_s_e_s _b_o_o_l.

   _c_h_t_y_p_e
