       Either iinniittssccrr(3X) or nneewwtteerrmm(3X) initializes _c_u_r_s_e_s.

       If  _n_c_u_r_s_e_s  is  configured  to  provide  separate _c_u_r_s_e_s and _t_i_n_f_o li‐
